Z||000009||Joe Torma||08-10-2001||02:03 AM||||Does it look mine?   I guess you can tell by the plenum and the front of it.  It used to have a plastic over it that said 3400.<P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/3400.gif">  <P>I had no idea my 3400 engine was a "vortec"  I wonder what the qualifications are for it to be called that...probably because it is in a van.  I really don't think they put it in and full size trucks.<P>It's a nice engine...<BR> Goes like hell...not that I really gotten on it.  I've almost finished tidying up the wires and my G-Tech is going to be in tomorrow.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  Toys.<P>If you do it, like Steve said, you'll need the whole computer...or take my route, aftermarket.<P>Joe<p>[This message has been edited by Joe Torma (edited 08-10-2001).]||||reg||1
